            "q": "thermal-conductivity",
            "e": -1,
            "phase": "solid"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "reference": "Bi needs the Biot length L_c and the solid conductivity k_s. L_c = V/A_s is the half-thickness of a slab cooled on both faces, r/2 for a long cylinder and r/3 for a sphere. A spatial solution uses the half-thickness or the radius.",
      "source": "spec-10"
    },
